<p>AQRABA KUT GAYE JAB SHAAH KE BARI BARI <br />
AUR ADUM CHALNE KI OOS SHAH NE KI TAYYARI<br />
KHAIME KA PARDA UTHA ZAINABUL EBA IK BARI<br />
DEKH MAQTAL KI TARAF KARNE LAGE NOOH ZAARI</p>

<p>KHULD KE KOOCH MEIN HUM KO NAHI BULWATE HO<br />
QAAFILE WALON HUMEIN CHHODHE CHALE JAATE HO<br />
SHEH KA NA RAHA KOI BHI YAWAR BAQI<br />
NA ALAMDAR RAHE AUR NA LASHKAR BAQI<br />
NA RAHE QASIME JARRAR NA AKBAR BAQI<br />
HAI FAQAT SIBTE NABI KA SARE ANWAR BAQI</p>

<p>HUM TO BAQI HAIN GHAM-O-RANJ UTHANE KE LIYE<br />
MAUT NE CHHODA HUMEIN ASHK BAHANE KE LIYE</p>

<p>SHABBIR KE MARNE KI HAI AB TAYYARI<br />
ZAKHM PAR ZAKHM LAGE HAIN TANE SHEH PAR QAARI<br />
BHOOK MEIN PYAAS MEIN GHASH AATE HAIN SAU SAU BARI<br />
BEECH MEIN IBNE ALI GIRD KHADE HAIN NARI<br />
APNE BIMARI SE SHARMINDA PISAR HOTA HAI<br />
QATL AB SAAMNE BETE KE PIDAR HOTA HAI</p>

<p>BABA KO MERE KOI BACHAALE AAKAR<br />
PHER DE LAAKE GALE PAR MERE KOI KHANJAR<br />
BAAD BABA KE PISAR KA NAHI JEENA BEHTAR<br />
BAAP TO QATL HO JEETA RAHE YE KHASTA JIGAR<br />
AHLEBAITE NABAWI PAR YE JAFAYEN HONGI<br />
BALWAE AAM MEIN SAR PAR NA RIDAYEIN HONGI</p>

<p>AQRABA KUT GAYE...</p>
